      <p>To map one deliverable or one root map:</p>
      <CodeBlock code={"dogsbay-xml report project-graph . -o beginner-map.html --arg deliverable=beginner-mac\ndogsbay-xml report project-graph . -o guide-map.html --arg map=audacity-guide.ditamap"} lang="bash" />
