      <CodeBlock code={"dogsbay-xml report project-health . -o health.html --arg map=audacity-guide.ditamap"} lang="bash" />
      <p>The page shows whether the project is clean, then one table per check. A rule that fails in many files appears once, with a count and the list of files.</p>
